From b05a5ca710a92b83c73c40584cfe9a39e1c93ef0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cheng Rui <286040359@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 05:10:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [Perf][Marlin] Reduce DS V4.1 Flash MoE padding on SM90

Use 64-element MXFP4 intermediate alignment for regular SM90 Marlin
with BF16 activations and no A8 input quantization. Preserve the
existing policy for other paths and callers without an activation dtype.

Cover the allocation, repack and TP loading contracts and add a
reproducible kernel benchmark for the 384-to-320 padding reduction.

Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Signed-off-by: Cheng Rui <286040359@qq.com>
